{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "83725d85-3cd8-8ab6-a204-2739f81d24f2",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T12:29:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rui Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:26:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:26:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Rui Medeiros. I am calling about a section of sidewalk that has heaved up, and I am afraid I tripped on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. Are you hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:26:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I was fortunate. A scraped palm and a sore knee, nothing more. But it is a hazard, and I would like it reported."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:27:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Where is the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:27:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 333 Chapel Street, on Historic Hill. The slab in front of the house has lifted at the seam, perhaps two inches higher than its neighbor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:27:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 333 Chapel. Did that happen recently, or has it been building up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:27:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It has been rising for some time, but it seems to have become worse after last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. I tripped on it this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:27:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. The freeze and thaw does that. Do you have any photographs of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:27:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I took several with my telephone. I can send them, if you will kindly tell me where."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:27:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that photos are available, and I can give you an email for the department in a moment. Let me get this entered first. Can I have a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. It is 401-555-0193."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:28:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0193. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:28:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would also kindly ask that the street be added to the repair list. The pavement along that block is in poor condition as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:28:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can put in the request to have Chapel Street looked at for the road and the sidewalk. I can't tell you when a crew will get to it, they're busy after a storm, but it'll be on record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:28:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I ask because I am raising my grandchild, and I am back to scheduling pickup times at the school. I walk that sidewalk several times a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Then it's worth getting on the list quickly. Until it's fixed, maybe mark it with something so nobody else trips."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:28:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sensible suggestion. I will place a cone there this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:28:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. You'll get the photo address from me in a second, hold on one moment. [pause] Okay, I'm sending it to your phone by text so you have it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:28:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is most kind. Thank you very much, Miss Arruda. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:29:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Medeiros. Take care of that knee."
    }
  ],
